---
layout: listing.njk
title: Our Story
description: Follow the build journey of Disco Carrot, from vision to mountain-ready art installation.
permalink: /our-story/
---

<div class="listing-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">The Build</p>
  <h1>Our Story</h1>
  <p>Follow along as we turn a 1972 Thiokol Spryte snowcat into a one-of-a-kind mobile DJ stage and art installation.</p>
</div>

<div class="listing-grid">
  {%- for post in collections.ourStory -%}
  <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="listing-card">
    {% if post.data.thumbnail %}
    <img src="{{ post.data.thumbnail }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}">
    {% endif %}
    <div class="listing-card-body">
      <div class="listing-card-date">{{ post.date | dateFormat }}</div>
      <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
      {% if post.data.excerpt %}<p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
      <span class="read-more">Read More →</span>
    </div>
  </a>
  {%- endfor -%}
</div>
